        "source": "Start with a **one-week utilization audit** of the compute fleet. Apply changes to a small cohort, track latency and error rates, and expand only after verifying service health.\n\n- Confirm the baseline with the billing owner.\n- Review recommendations with service owners.\n- Record realized savings separately from projected savings.\n\nRead the [AWS cost optimization guidance](https://aws.amazon.com/aws-cost-management/aws-cost-optimization/)."
